3- on the VPS, i added the VLAN subnet as allowed IPs.:
    AllowedIPs = 10.50.0.2/32, 192.168.10.0/24, 192.168.20.0/24, 192.168.30.0/24, 192.168.40.0/24
    restart
    sudo wg-quick down wg0
sudo wg-quick up wg0    